{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<h2 id=\"activity-name\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></h2><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">楼宇“最后一公里”一直是末端配送的一个重要场景，但快递人员每日频繁出入，无固定收发地址以及门口随意摆摊等问题，都对楼宇环境、人员管理等提出极高挑战。尤其眼下受疫情防控的影响，一站式的无接触配送服务更是成为众多楼宇的刚性需求。<br/></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/111664/1/3162/78068/5ea64f52Ed2d4c57f/5ee0ecad91bb1b2a.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></span></div></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">小蜜蜂智慧服务中心，依托京东快递智能技术与多元生态的优势，对楼宇内所有快递包裹进行集中统一取送管理，在提高快件安全与配送效率的同时，提供规范化品牌服务的管理模式，进一步提升楼宇品牌形象，打造智慧化楼宇整体解决方案。<br/></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/108157/9/14319/177695/5ea64f95E5b649c22/3c31e387b0387119.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></span></div></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">据介绍，位于北京市东四环中路的远洋国际中心，建成于2006年，总建筑面积23万平方米，为甲级商务楼宇，汇聚了近400家知名企业，约有2万人在此办公，日均快递单量达到1200单左右。而小蜜蜂智慧服务中心在远洋国际中心落成后，各家快递公司可将货物统一交接至服务中心，由专人通过专门的系统和设备，对包裹进行分拣、暂存，用户可选择上门派送或到服务中心自行提取。</span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/></span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">同时，用智能化技术手段突破“最后一公里”也是小蜜蜂智慧服务中心优先考虑的路径。此次，<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\">依托京东快递在智能技术方面不断探索，自助快递柜、无人车、云匣等智能设备，以及“鸡毛信”等通过系统实现包裹实时定位等智能技术的应用，也将使得楼宇的末端配送变革呈现自动化、智能化和个性化的特征，为客户提供更加高效、便捷的快递服务。<br/></strong></span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/119626/12/1698/92562/5ea65006Ed5e82cb8/a2f859197b5fc77b.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/><br/></div><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">此外，小蜜蜂智慧服务中心还联动京东物流集团各方面资源，在服务中心内增设洗衣、闲置存储、旧衣回收、纸箱回收等多项特色服务，在打造末端服务多元生态的同时，进一步提升服务水平。</span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/></span></section><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;\"><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; line-height: 1.75em;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 10px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; display: inline-block; width: 677px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(216, 40, 33); box-shadow: rgb(204, 204, 204) 3.2px 3.2px 4px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">远洋物业相关负责人表示：“<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\">作为国内快递企业智慧化楼宇整体解决方案的标杆，我们很高兴能够与小蜜蜂智慧服务中心达成合作，这有利于我们进一步提升楼宇管理水平和客户的快递服务体验，也能吸引更多企业入驻</strong>。”</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; white-space: normal;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">京东快递合作运营相关负责人曲丽丽表示，<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\">小蜜蜂智慧服务中心下一步将持续通过技术及模式的不断创新，通过更加安全的交付与精准的触达，逐步扩大封闭社区、商务写字楼、工业园等更多元场景的覆盖率，为消费者带去更多种服务选择，致力于成为未来城市智慧生活的标配，最大程度满足个性化、多元化的快递服务需求。</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></div><br/></section>", "contentAbstract": "4月22日，京东快递全国首个高端商务楼宇一站式取送服务中心——小蜜蜂智慧服务中心，在北京远洋国际中心举行落成剪彩仪式。据介绍，小蜜蜂智慧服务中心，依托京东快递智能技术与多元生态的优势，整合多家快递公司系统与资源，为高端楼宇、封闭社区等场所，提供包含快递、外卖、洗衣、送菜等综合取送服务，打造高端、便捷、无忧的一站式末端服务体验。", "contentCode": "content00237", "contentTitle": "方便！多家快递一个地儿取，京东快递全国首个高端商务楼宇一站式服务中心落地", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1587957800000, "id": 520, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/120834/5/22878/168601/6245b2adE0bec2715/16424274563838f5.jpg", "updateTime": 1648734894000}}